one Right\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Finding ways to engage your workforce is essential. Corporate training videos are the answer for many organizations, but not all video content is created equal. That’s where Ninja Tropic eLearning stands out. Our award-winning corporate training video production services provide engaging, impactful learning experiences. We design videos that don’t just teach – they build skills and influence attitudes. For companies aiming for measurable outcomes, Ninja Tropic’s corporate training videos deliver.\\r\\n\\r\\nImagine a training solution your employees want to engage with. Imagine content that’s interactive, accessible, and, most importantly, effective. Our goal is to create videos that resonate with today’s learners, building knowledge and influencing behavior. We understand the stakes of corporate training, and our team is dedicated to creating videos that help your business reach its goals.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":839,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eCorporate \\u0026 Educational \\u003cem\\u003eTraining Video Production \\u003c/em\\u003eProcess\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We analyze your KPIs, your individual audiences’ needs, your training mission, and your valuable content to develop ideas and bring your concept into video-based reality. With impressive and relatable graphics paired with an engaging voice, your learners won’t be able to take their eyes off your new, trending educational content.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nYou’ll partner with our award-winning educational video company every step of the way to ensure that the final product is on brand and on point – something you’ll be proud to launch because customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":666,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eOur Process\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"We believe effective training starts with understanding your business goals. That’s why our process begins with a comprehensive needs analysis. We get to know your company, your audience, and the specific outcomes you’re looking for. Once we have a clear vision, we move to storyboarding, script development, and video production.\\r\\n\\r\\nOur team takes an instructional design approach, ensuring every element serves a purpose. Whether we’re using animation, live-action, or a mix of both, each video is crafted to engage and educate. We also build our training videos with scalability in mind. Need to update content? Want to adapt a video for a different department? We make it easy.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith regular check-ins and clear feedback loops, our process is transparent. You know what’s happening at every stage, ensuring a final product that aligns with your expectations. Our process is streamlined, efficient, and geared toward results.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch3\\u003eWhy use Corporate Training Videos?\\r\\n\\u003c/h3\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Why choose corporate training videos? The answer is simple – they’re engaging, flexible, and powerful. In-person training is limited by time, space, and cost. But with corporate training videos, you can reach employees anytime, anywhere. Videos are especially effective for today’s mobile workforce, allowing employees to learn on their schedule.\\r\\n\\r\\nTraining videos also offer consistency. Everyone gets the same information, presented the same way, no matter where they are. This is especially valuable for onboarding, compliance training, and skills development. And because video allows for a variety of teaching techniques – storytelling, demonstrations, simulations – it caters to different learning styles.\\r\\n\\r\\nInvesting in corporate training videos means investing in retention. Studies show that people remember video content better than text. With the right video, you’re not just delivering information; you’re creating a lasting learning experience.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":854,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Types of <em>Corporate Training </em>Videos</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"container\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Every business has unique needs, which is why we offer a variety of corporate training video types. Here are just some of the popular options. Check out the largest portfolio of&nbsp;<strong>online learning videos!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Onboarding Videos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Introduce new employees to your company culture, values, and processes. Onboarding videos help new hires feel welcomed and informed from day one.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/qZH8N4rFDEA\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Compliance and Safety Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"These are critical for organizations that need to adhere to industry standards. Compliance videos help employees understand and retain vital safety protocols.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/F3otdznbweU\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Skill Development:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Our skill-building videos focus on developing competencies. Whether it’s soft skills or technical skills, we create videos that make learning actionable.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/pIyO12stE_U\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Product Training:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Got a new product? Product training videos teach your internal team (or even your customers) everything they need to know.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/iUNAx42JZI0\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Sales Enablement:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Our sales training videos help your team understand products and customer interactions better, making them more effective and confident.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/utN8CzWv76Q\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/grid-items {\"name\":\"acf/grid-items\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Training Video Case Studies to [gradient]Inspire You[/gradient]\",\"_title\":\"field_6977a3f378dce\",\"description\":\"Our portfolio speaks for itself. We’ve worked with organizations across industries, creating videos that inspire, educate, and inform. We take pride in our attention to detail – every project is an opportunity to push the boundaries of what training videos can achieve.\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom large corporations to nonprofits, we’ve developed solutions that get results. Our clients see improved knowledge retention, reduced time in training, and higher engagement rates. We encourage you to explore our past work and see how our approach could benefit your organization.\",\"_description\":\"field_6977a40278dcf\",\"items_0_tag\":\"\",\"_items_0_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_0_title\":\"The Wonderful Company\",\"_items_0_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_0_image\":779,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_1_tag\":\"\",\"_items_1_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_1_title\":\"The Nature Conservancy\",\"_items_1_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_1_image\":781,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items_2_tag\":\"\",\"_items_2_tag\":\"field_69a6591724e81\",\"items_2_title\":\"AT\\u0026T Business\",\"_items_2_title\":\"field_6977a41d78dd1\",\"items_2_image\":859,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_6977a42478dd2\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_6977a42d78dd3\",\"items\":3,\"_items\":\"field_6977a40c78dd0\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Training Video Styles</strong></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"container\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We offer a range of video styles to meet your needs:<br></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Live-Action:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Perfect for relatable, human-centered training. Live-action videos add a personal touch, making the content feel real and relevant.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/utN8CzWv76Q\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Animation:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"When visuals need to be custom, animation is a powerful tool. Animation helps explain complex concepts in a way that’s easy to understand and engaging.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/HNuHy3BrlRw\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Interactive Videos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"For companies looking to engage employees actively, interactive videos turn passive viewing into active learning.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/Xe4Au38pRtg\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Screencasts and Software Demos:\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"These are ideal for technical training and software onboarding, showing employees exactly what to do.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"https://youtu.be/YgJWMdyL2b4\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":\"\",\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003e Pricing\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our pricing is designed to be flexible and affordable. We know every company has a budget, and we work with you to deliver quality within your range. Whether you’re looking for a one-off video or a complete training series, our team can create a solution that fits your budget. Transparency is key – there are no hidden costs. We provide a clear, upfront quote, so you know what to expect.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor companies needing extensive training content, we also offer subscription services, allowing you to budget for a steady flow of training materials.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/awards {\"name\":\"acf/awards\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Rated Top Training Video Training Production Companies\",\"_title\":\"field_697ac00ba2c5c\",\"content\":\"Our commitment to excellence hasn’t gone unnoticed. Ninja Tropic has been rated among the top corporate training video production companies. We’re known for our creativity, reliability, and results-driven approach. But don’t take our word for it. Our clients have seen the results firsthand – from boosted new employee engagement to more effective training programs.\\r\\n\\r\\nRecognition from our clients and industry leaders alike motivates us to continue delivering the best training videos in the business. We’re proud to be recognized, and we’re excited to bring that award-winning service to your company.\",\"_content\":\"field_697ac01ca2c5d\",\"link\":{\"title\":\"Check out our awards!\",\"url\":\"http://localhost:8080/awards/\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link\":\"field_697ac027a2c5e\",\"items_0_image\":166,\"_items_0_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_0_link\":\"\",\"_items_0_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_1_image\":170,\"_items_1_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_1_link\":\"\",\"_items_1_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_2_image\":167,\"_items_2_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_2_link\":\"\",\"_items_2_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_3_image\":168,\"_items_3_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_3_link\":\"\",\"_items_3_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_4_image\":169,\"_items_4_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_4_link\":\"\",\"_items_4_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items_5_image\":165,\"_items_5_image\":\"field_697ac046a2c60\",\"items_5_link\":\"\",\"_items_5_link\":\"field_697ac056a2c61\",\"items\":6,\"_items\":\"field_697ac039a2c5f\",\"stats_0_value\":\"450\",\"_stats_0_value\":\"field_697ac780421cd\",\"stats_0_label\":\"projects delivered\",\"_stats_0_label\":\"field_697ac788421ce\",\"stats_0_ring_text\":\"Projects executed successfully\",\"_stats_0_ring_text\":\"field_697ac793421cf\",\"stats_1_value\":\"35\",\"_stats_1_value\":\"field_697ac780421cd\",\"stats_1_label\":\"industry sectors\",\"_stats_1_label\":\"field_697ac788421ce\",\"stats_1_ring_text\":\"Industry Sectors Pool\",\"_stats_1_ring_text\":\"field_697ac793421cf\",\"stats\":2,\"_stats\":\"field_697ac774421cc\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"mt-6\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eReferences and Reviews\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Still unsure? We’re happy to connect you with references who can speak to our work. Our clients appreciate our collaborative process, our focus on results, and our ability to bring their vision to life. Read our reviews, talk to our clients, and see why Ninja Tropic eLearning is the choice for employee training videos\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":865,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"container\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"className\":\"container\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons container\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/case-studies/\">Check out our clients testimonials!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Related </strong><em><strong>Solutions<br></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"2rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:2rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns container\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":873,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Learning-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-873\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Mobile Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Looking for eLearning solutions on the go? Mobile Learning is the answer! It offers the flexibility to learn anytime, anywhere, allowing your team to learn on their own terms.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":872,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/scenarios-based-learing.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-872\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Scenarios-Based Learning</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">When learners visualize themselves in relevant scenarios, scenario-based video eLearning enhances understanding and promotes effective implementation. It’s ideal for hands-on learners!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":871,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Microlearning-solutions-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-871\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Microlearning Solutions </h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Got a few minutes between meetings? Struggling to fit in mandatory training? With demanding schedules, Microlearning solutions from Ninja Tropic offer the condensed learning you need!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"alt\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alt\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Learn more</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get Started with [gradient]Video Training Production[/gradient] Today!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Ready to get your video training production off the ground but need a bit of help? We’ve got you. Talk to our experts about your project and see if we can help you focus on what you do best, and we’ll take care of the video-based educational training production. Go ahead and get the ball rolling by filling out the form!\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Video Training Production','','publish','closed','closed','','video-training-production','','','2026-06-29 00:16:40','2026-06-29 00:16:40','',333,'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=939',0,'page','',0),(2606,7,'2022-11-23 10:21:42','2022-11-23 17:21:42','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1>Product Knowledge Training: Everything You Need to Know</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#title1\">What Is Product Knowledge?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#title2\">Why Is Product Knowledge Important & What Are the Benefits?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#title3\">Product Knowledge Training Objectives (and Use Cases)</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#title4\">What Are the Different Types of Product Knowledge?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#title5\">How to Develop, Implement, and Automate Product Knowledge Training</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#title6\">Final Thoughts on Product Knowledge Training</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to take your business to the next level? Then you need one thing: excellent customer service and happy customers (okay fine; that\'s two things!)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The point is that you need to deliver both on the product side and on delivering exceptional support to satisfy customers. This is what sets you apart from your competitors.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To do that, product knowledge is imperative. It\'s what creates raving reviews, referrals, and satisfied customers. Without proper <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/product-training/\">product knowledge training</a>, you\'re dead in the water.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Because it results in the opposite effect, irritated and annoyed customers, who are left scratching their heads as to how to solve their problem. If you\'ve ever been on the other end of terrible customer support, you\'ll understand what we mean.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Today, we\'re going to dive into the different aspects of creating a product knowledge training program so your team members can have in-depth knowledge and become certifiable experts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ready to go?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let\'s do it!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before we begin, it\'s important to understand the meaning of product knowledge. So, what is product knowledge?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Product knowledge training allows employees to get a thorough understanding of all the information about your products or services. This includes a product training program for the sales team, marketing team, and customer service and can even include the end-user of a product or service to facilitate a working knowledge base for all parties involved to understand the features, benefits, and capabilities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Simply put:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s an in-depth understanding of the product or service for all parties involved.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Is Product Knowledge Important &What Are the Benefits?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you\'re wondering what the point of product knowledge training is, let us fill you in. There are many benefits of training your employees and sales reps to understand your products and services using bite-sized training sessions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In order to understand the importance of a product knowledge training program, let\'s discuss these benefits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Benefits of Product Training</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There\'s no reason you shouldn\'t have a product training program in place because there are endless uses for it. Here are the <strong>most</strong> important benefits:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4>1. Outstanding Customer Support</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The most important aspect of your product offering should be the level of service being presented to your customers or clients. That\'s why all of your employees need to be able to communicate product knowledge to your customers effectively.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is imperative for customer acquisition and retention.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every employee should understand product features and create a positive experience for potential customers. Without product knowledge training, the reputation of your company is on the line.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most companies struggling to grow have one thing in common:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A collective lack of proper employee knowledge from team members.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4>2. Increased Sales & Revenue</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A knowledgeable team of sales reps will provide the benefit of increased sales.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s simple:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Product knowledge training breeds confident employees. Confident employees who are passionate, well-versed, and can provide excellent support boost the reputation of the company as a whole.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Product knowledge training helps generate brand advocates inside and outside of the company. It\'s just a smart investment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s the difference between having a team of employees filling a role within the company versus an expert sales team that creates trust and credibility through competence.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Where do you stand?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4>3. Improves Product Learning Knowledge & Retention</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Product knowledge training isn\'t limited to employees and sales teams. Customers also need online training about your products or services. There are a few ways to do this:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.hubspot.com/knowledge-base\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Creating a knowledge base</a> starts with internal knowledge training. When a team member understands a product through and through, they improve the efficiency of your company. This is done by providing detailed product information throughout every step of the customer value journey, starting with documentation. Doing so results in more use of the product.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your Knowledge base shouldn\'t just be long and boring text littered with technical jargon. To provide the best customer experience (and the most value), you need to incorporate videos, <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/blog-5-ways-to-use-2d-animation-for-elearning/\">animations</a>, screencasts, product overviews, reviews, etc., into your online training. This not only makes it more interactive and engaging, but it also allows customers to retain information when learning about your product.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It all starts with developing effective employee product knowledge training for your entire organization. Do that, and you\'ll build a positive company culture and instill confidence in every team member.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Long story short:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Develop product training that allows your employees and customers to be product knowledge experts. Your company will reap the benefits from reduced support requests from customers and more referrals from word-of-mouth marketing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The overall objective of your product knowledge training program should be a deep understanding of features, benefits, and capabilities; the end result should be the ability to train individuals to sell, market, understand, and use the product.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To do this, you may need to include several product learning modules. Let\'s go over the different use cases.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Product Sales Training for Knowledgeable Sales Reps</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The most obvious use case is for sales reps. The objective for sales teams is to get the most benefit from becoming a subject matter authority specializing in your company\'s product offerings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This should be the norm for most organizations. Unfortunately, it\'s not!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This provides an opportunity for those who invest in product knowledge training to have a competitive advantage over other competitors in the marketplace.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Training your sales reps with a dedicated product learning module specific to the role should educate them on topics such as:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Product Knowledge Training for Customer Service</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Product knowledge for customer support employees is almost as important as it is for sales reps. In some cases, it\'s even more important.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The success of a company isn\'t just about making sales. It\'s also about customer retention after the sale.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The objective of product knowledge training for customer service employees is to provide quality support that instills trust and confidence, so customers keep coming back (and spreading goodwill).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Product knowledge training for customer service should include the following for learners:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Product Knowledge Training for Marketers</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some say a sale is made before a customer\'s first touchpoint with the company. How so? Marketing!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most marketing teams never receive any substantial level of product training. This is a mistake since they are in direct control of the messaging of your product or service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>How can you accurately describe something you don\'t understand? What are you leaving out of your marketing campaigns in terms of communicating the product to your audience?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The objective of product knowledge training for marketing professionals should be to accurately understand how to describe the uses and the problems a product solves to potential customers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here\'s what should be included in the training modules for your marketing team:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Product Training (Learning) For Customers</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Another learning module to implement is product training for customers. The objective here is to properly onboard customers and indoctrinate them into your business or brand with product knowledge. Some of the biggest brand advocates get enamored with a brand through training.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Training customers should provide word-of-mouth referrals and online social sharing to expand your reach. It can also help reduce the workload of your employees. If customers are properly trained on a product, they won\'t need as much assistance from sales reps or customer service.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you develop your training modules for customers, be sure to include bite-sized information about the following:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are quite a few different types of product knowledge you may want to incorporate into your learning management system (LMS). We\'ve covered a few already, but here\'s a short list of things to consider when creating your company\'s training modules for the growth and success of your business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Mobile Learning</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mobile learning, also known as <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/blog-what-is-mobile-learning-m-learning-benefits-tips/\">M-learning</a>, is an excellent option for your LMS that allows you to incorporate training to educate your employees through the use of digital devices such as smartphones or tablets.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Blended Learning</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Blended education allows for the ability to combine in-person instruction with a mobile learning environment. The ability to increase knowledge retention with engaging online materials for employees makes <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/blended-learning/\">blended learning</a> a highly sought-after option for your LMS.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Microlearning</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/blog-microlearning-video/\">Microlearning</a> is the use of short, educational explainer videos that use live action and animation to create engaging eLearning content. The idea is to break complex topics down into short-form training sessions that are easy to understand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Video Animation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/video-animation/\">Video animation</a> allows for highly engaging content that improves the eLearning experience for companies and employees. Whether it\'s for online sales training or building skills for your customer service team, video animation helps to increase knowledge retention.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Interactive Videos</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Interactive video gives you the ability to allow employees to be in control of their training by making them part of the story. This is typically done with interactive quizzes, \"choose your own adventure\" (or branched story) videos, and question and answer format.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Scenario-Based Learning</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Adding scenario-based learning into your eLearning experience for employees and customers allows for the use of role-play to deepen understanding. This is great for sales reps as you can walk through a few scenarios that can help improve their skills.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Video Storytelling</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Video storytelling is a key component of establishing brand awareness as a strategy in your brand messaging. However, it\'s also an integral part of the internal training process and may be used for <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/employee-onboarding-training/\">employee onboarding</a>. It starts with creating a narrative to implement into your training.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To develop your product knowledge training and successfully scale your business, you just need to follow the following steps.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Step 1: Create an LMS or Internal Training Course</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In order to improve efficiency, you need to get an idea of what type of training your company needs. You can either create your LMS on your own or choose to go with an eLearning agency that offers <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/custom-elearning-development/\">custom development</a>. In either case, you\'ll need to conduct a training needs analysis to outline the type of knowledge training you would like to produce.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Step 2: Choose Your eLearning Solutions</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once you have an idea of which training to produce, you\'ll need to select which types of eLearning solutions you\'d like to incorporate into the production process. You may already have some key ideas in mind. If not, you may want to review the section on product knowledge types (or our website) to get a headstart on improving the performance of your training.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Step 3: Produce Your Training Assets</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This step requires a bit of planning. Mostly because it requires a small amount of technical setup, like obtaining the proper equipment and video editing software. You\'ll also want to determine the KPIs or training objectives, script your videos, and do some editing in post-production. Check out our post about <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/blog-how-to-plan-create-effective-employee-training-videos-step-by-step-guide/\">planning effective training videos</a> for more information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Step 4: Test Your eLearning Experience</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After everything is recorded, produced, edited, and ready to go, you\'ll want to test it. This is done by simply informing an initial group of employees (<a href=\"https://www.applause.com/blog/understanding-beta-testing-examples-benefits-challenges\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">beta testers</a>) to go through the training and providing their feedback. Once you get a few of your sales reps or employees to take the online training, you\'ll want to measure the performance to ensure the objectives were met.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Step 5: Automate Your Workflows</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As long as you\'re satisfied with the training system you\'ve put in place, you may want to put some processes in place to make life easier as you grow. Here are just a few things you can do to save time:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At the end of the day, you want to streamline the entire training process to scale effectively.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3>Step 6: Measure and Improve</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After some time, you should have everything you need in place to make your training run like clockwork. However, what do you do with the employee feedback? Once you acquire enough data, you\'ll want to make tweaks or improvements to the program to improve its effectiveness. You can measure its performance and continuously refine it for better results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So there you have it! That\'s everything you need to know to create effective product training. You just need to understand the product knowledge training needs of your company and take it step by step. Need some help along the way? Feel free to <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/contact-us/\">contact us</a> for custom eLearning development.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Subscribe Now!</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->','Product Knowledge Training:  Everything You Need to Know','Product knowledge training is imperative to the success of an organization. Read this article to get an in-depth understanding on the product learning process.','publish','closed','closed','','blog-product-knowledge-training-everything-you-need-to-know','','','2026-06-25 20:26:09','2026-06-25 20:26:09','',0,'http://localhost:8080/blog-product-knowledge-training-everything-you-need-to-know/',0,'post','',0),(2614,7,'2022-11-21 14:48:24','2022-11-21 21:48:24','<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1>Science of eLearning Animation: How Animation is Used in Education</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Too often, educational video is dismissed as an “easy way out” when it comes to teaching new material, especially if those videos happen to be animated.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#title1\">How We Learn</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#title2\">How Does Animation Help Us Learn?</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#title3\">Benefits of Incorporating Animation into Corporate Training</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#title4\">How to Incorporate Animation into the Workplace</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"#title5\">The Bottom Line</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This way of thinking is particularly difficult to shake in the corporate world.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After all, people spend too much time in front of screens as it is. Shouldn’t the workplace be all about PowerPoint presentations, sleek graphs and charts, and lofty talks about “the bottom line”?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The reality is that animation in an educational learning environment can transform the way we grasp and engage with new material. But how does it work? In order to fully understand how animation is used in education to help employees understand complicated ideas and processes, it is important to understand how exactly the brain takes in new information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before you can teach anyone effectively, it helps to know how the brain works. <a href=\"https://www.educationcorner.com/cognitive-load-theory/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cognitive Load Theory</a>, developed by John Sweller in 1988 has been instrumental in educational innovation. As it turns out, this theory can be aptly applied to any kind of learning.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Cognitive load theory neatly divides our learning process into three sections: sensory memory, working memory, and long-term memory.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sensory memory is what a person is immediately aware of, before they can understand the context (e.g. reviewing a series of buttons on a control panel before even knowing what any of those buttons do).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>That unit of <a href=\"https://www.webmd.com/brain/what-are-sensory-memory-examples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">sensory memory</a> moves quickly to working memory–think trying to make sense of the buttons’ significance. Finally, a well-designed training program will help an employee transfer the newly presented information from working memory to <a href=\"https://www.verywellmind.com/what-is-long-term-memory-2795347\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">long-term memory</a>, where it can remain indefinitely (being able to recall what buttons to select to complete a task safely on the job).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While long-term memory is believed to be infinite, sensory memory and working memory are limited. Sensory memory is instantaneous; it alerts the brain as soon as something of note occurs. Moreover, sensory memory is useful for communicating our surroundings, but has little capacity for recall and doesn’t process information well.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.scientificamerican.com/article/working-memory-how-you-keep-things-ldquo-in-mind-rdquo-over-the-short-term/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Working memory</a> can, generally speaking, hold between 3-5 pieces of information. So, if the sensory memory is overloaded, the working memory quickly clogs and information is entering and exiting the limited space of working memory before anything can be understood and committed to long-term memory.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With such a limited bandwidth in both sensory and working memory, it is extremely important not to cognitively overload the mind when trying to convey important information.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are two primary ways in which information makes it from working memory to long-term memory: visually/pictorially and auditorily/orally. Generally speaking, information is best learned when combining visual and auditory methods: this is known as the <a href=\"https://link.springer.com/referenceworkentry/10.1007/978-1-4419-1428-6_256\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">“Modality Effect”</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Visual information and auditory information don’t compete with each other in the same way that, say two visual pieces of information, would compete with one another.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For example, med students may struggle to understand how to read some x-rays thoroughly if someone just explains the process to them or hands them a sheet of paper that illustrates the steps with little to no explanation. However, if that same process is shown on screen while someone narrates what is happening as it happens, learners are much more likely to commit each of these steps to memory. This is the key to how animation is used in education: audio-visuals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Science of eLearning Animation: How Does Animation Help Us Learn?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If a mix of auditory information and visual information is all that’s needed to lighten the cognitive burden on the average learner, why is animation so important to helping that learner better grasp new material?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Simply put, animation offers one unique element: movement. This activates the third modality of learning: <a href=\"https://tophat.com/glossary/k/kinesthetic-learning/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">kinesthetic</a> learning (hands-on learning).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Think of it this way: would you rather watch someone point at a few indistinguishable gray objects on a desk or watch someone put each and every one of those tools to use?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The latter is not only more entertaining, it also allows learners to engage with what they are seeing by using both their sense of sight and their sense of hearing. Seeing static images on a screen simply does not stimulate these senses. Finally, when a learner can interact with the animations, they are committing the new information firmly into the long-term memory bank allowing for the science of eLearning to take place using their senses to learn.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Do you want to learn more about eLearning Video Animation? <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/blog-video-animation-post/\">Read more here</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every day, more and more corporations are choosing to <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/blog-why-video-based-learning-is-a-must-for-corporate-elearning/\">incorporate animation</a> into their training and educational material. Not just because it’s easier, cheaper, and faster, but because it is simply better than traditional training methods. Here are a few reasons how animation is used in corporate education and why it works:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It perhaps goes without saying that kids are more inclined to watch cartoons than they are to watch <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/live-action-host-video/\">live-action content</a>. Believe it or not, however, adults are very much the same in many regards. This is because cartoons signal the brain that it is time for something fun: an escape from the real world into a world where anything is possible. For this reason, subconsciously, the brain is more likely to engage with animated content than it is to engage with live-action content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Watching cartoons presents the learner with an opportunity to disengage from the common stressors of reality without disengaging from the material presented. Information relayed through animation is essentially making its way into the minds of learners without those pesky thoughts of bills that need to be paid and milk that needs to be picked up on the way home. in other words, it limits distractiions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Although contracting an animated video can be costly, it can take less than half the number of people to put together a great animated presentation as it would to put together a mediocre live action presentation. Where a live action video would need a set, a location, writers, directors, a cast, and a crew, an animated video team would need only a handful of animators with as many computers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Furthermore, in a pinch, learners are still more likely to respond to a poorly produced animated video than they are to respond to a poorly produced live action video, and one will cost you far less.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In a live action shoot, your vision is often at the mercy of the hired creative team. When working with finite resources, it can be difficult to translate your exact vision into dynamic learning material, especially when you have only human actors to work with (who may be incredibly talented but just lack the vibrance and flexibility of a cartoon character).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In eLearning animation, you have the liberty to use your exact imagery/branding, while also being free (and encouraged) to abandon realism when conceptualizing how best to illustrate your point.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Additionally, if you don’t like the finished product in a live action video, it can be extremely difficult to reassemble the team in order to rewrite, reshoot, or re-edit. With eLearning animation, edits and additions, while not always cheap, can be done with much less overall headache than having to newly configure 25 conflicting schedules.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It is easy to get swept up in the conflicting information of the information age. Some hail the television as a marvelous invention; others condemn it as a distraction that has no place in schools or workplaces. But what is the truth?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The fact of the matter is that animation is the <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/blog-interactive-video-platforms-are-the-future-of-online-learning/\">future of education</a>. When viewed in conjunction with the cognitive load theory, animation effectively accesses all three matrices for processing information: sensory memory, working memory, and long-term memory. How we use animation in educational training is a powerful tool at your disposal when applied correctly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Incorporate Animation Into the Workplace?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Incorporating educational animation into a lesson plan does not need to be all-consuming. The beauty of educational animation is that it facilitates discussion and practical applications, which can further engrain the material into the learner’s long-term memory.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>eLearning Animation can also reinforce material already learned, encouraging the learner to view the material in a different context. This is especially helpful when animation is used for procedural training: the learner can be taught the process, and then immediately relate it to their working environment with the help of an animated video.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>eLearning animation does not need to be rigidly structured into a curriculum, but it is encouraged that it appears in the educational/training material with some regularity. According to a study published in the Journal of Education for Teaching (JET), presenting a consistent cast of characters in animated eLearning videos will heighten one’s ability to empathize and connect with the material.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In sum, how animation is used in education simply opens the door to better education; all that’s left to do is walk through.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Already have a project in mind? We can help you create engaging eLearning Animation and Training Videos. Reach out for a <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/elearning-video-animation-companies-free-consultation/\">free consultation</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Read more:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Subscribe Now!</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->','Science of eLearning Animation: How Animation is Used in Education','Creating an eLearning training program isn&#8217;t easy. Learning about the behavioral science of how eLearning animation is used in education will help.','publish','closed','closed','','blog-science-behind-educational-animation-in-elearning-and-training-videos','','','2026-06-25 20:26:12','2026-06-25 20:26:12','',0,'http://localhost:8080/blog-science-behind-educational-animation-in-elearning-and-training-videos/',0,'post','',0);
